# Findings the Trivy repository scan (the "Trivy repository scan" step of ci.yml) must not fail on.
# Upgrade first (AGENTS.md, "CI"): an entry is only for a finding with no fix, or in code that
# cannot be reached. One ID per line, a "# reason" comment above it and an expiry in Trivy's
# format, for example:
#
#   # Not reachable: the vulnerable function is never called.
#   CVE-2099-0001 exp:2027-01-31
#
# An expired entry is removed in the next PR that touches this file. Never ignore without a reason.
#
# No entries today: the first scan found nothing.
